OL,3,GNEWSADogs dive into art deco lido for
OL,4,Aannual swim
OL,5,
OL,6,FDogs soaked up the autumn sunshine
OL,7,Fwhile taking to the water at an event
OL,8,Fheld ahead of the annual deep clean of
OL,9,Fa swimming lido.
OL,11,FThe dog day, now in its eighth year,
OL,12,Fwas held at the art deco Jubilee Pool
OL,13,Fin Penzance on Sunday.
OL,15,FOrganisers said most dogs were quick to
OL,16,Fjump in, while others needed a bit of
OL,17,Fcoaxing from their wetsuit-clad owners.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
