OL,3,GNEWSADogs dive into art deco lido for
OL,4,Aannual swim
OL,5,
OL,6,FPenzance Council said it had been a
OL,7,Flong-term supporter of the pool as a
OL,8,Fcommunity facility and had allocated
OL,9,F#40,000 of funding for this financial
OL,10,Fyear to help with the costs of winter
OL,11,Fmaintenance and subsidising entry for
OL,12,Flocals.
